emote","company":"Swades Ai","location":"Remote","date_posted":"2026-09-07","url":"https://www.naukri.com/job-listings-qa-automation-engineer-sdet-remote-swades-ai-india-3-to-8-years-070926000310","experience":"3-8 Yrs","is_walkin":false},{"title":"QA Automation","company":"V Group Inc","location":"Remote","date_posted":"2026-09-07","url":"https://www.naukri.com/job-listings-qa-automation-v-group-inc-bengaluru-6-to-11-years-070926033560","experience":"6-11 Yrs","skills":[2,3,4,19,20,24,100,102,103],"is_walkin":false,"description":"Automation Engineer \n Role Overview We are looking for an experienced Automation Engineer with a strong background in web and mobile application testing. The ideal candidate will have hands-on expertise in WebDriverIO, TypeScript, Selenium, Cucumber, Java, and automation framework development . \n You will be responsible for designing, developing, and maintaining robust automation frameworks and test solutions while working closely with development, QA, and business teams in an Agile environment. \n Key Responsibilities Design, develop, and maintain scalable automation frameworks for web and mobile applications. Develop and execute automated test scripts using WebDriverIO and TypeScript . Perform functional and automation testing for web and mobile applications . Develop and maintain automation solutions using Selenium with Cucumber/TestNG/JUnit . Design and enhance BDD-based automation frameworks . Identify, troubleshoot, and resolve issues within automated testing processes. Integrate automated tests with CI/CD pipelines and support continuous testing practices. Collaborate with developers, QA engineers, product teams, and other stakeholders in an Agile environment . Maintain test cases, defects, and test execution results using tools such as JIRA and TestRail . Participate in framework design discussions and contribute to improving automation standards and best practices. Work effectively with geographically distributed teams and communicate technical information clearly to both technical and business stakeholders. \n Required Technical Skills 6+ years of relevant experience in Software Test Automation. Strong hands-on experience with WebDriverIO . Strong experience with TypeScript . Good hands-on experience with Selenium WebDriver . Experience with Cucumber and BDD . Strong programming experience in Java . Experience with TestNG and/or JUnit . Hands-on experience in automation framework design and development . Experience with automation testing for web and mobile applications . Good understanding of HTML and CSS . Strong knowledge of Git/version control systems . Experience with CI/CD pipelines and Jenkins . Experience with test management tools such as JIRA and TestRail . Good understanding of Agile/Scrum methodologies . \n Preferred Skills Experience designing reusable and scalable automation frameworks. Experience working with distributed or geographically dispersed teams. Strong analytical and problem-solving abilities. Good understanding of software development and testing methodologies. Strong written and verbal communication skills. \n What Were Looking For Strong automation and programming fundamentals. Ability to independently design and develop automation solutions. Strong debugging and problem-solving skills. Ability to collaborate effectively with cross-functional teams. Flexibility and willingness to work in a fast-paced, Agile environment. Ability to communicate technical concepts effectively with both IT and business stakeholders. \n Experience 6+ years of relevant experience in Test Automation \n If interested please share your resume to below mail ID meghah@vgroupinc.com\n\nKey Skills: TypeScript,Javascript,QA Automation,Selenium,Webdriverio,BDD,Appium,Ci/Cd"},{"title":"QA AI Automation Engineer","company":"Terrafinn Technologies","location":"Remote","date_posted":"2026-09-08","url":"https://www.naukri.com/job-listings-qa-ai-automation-engineer-terrafinn-technologies-mumbai-all-areas-7-to-11-years-080926015331","experience":"7-11 Yrs","skills":[1,2,3,4,14,15,17,18,19,20,25,27,103],"is_walkin":false,"description":"Company Name: TerraFinn Technologies Website: www.terrafinn.com Mode: Full-time, remote Experience: 8+ Years Joining: Immediate Lead/Senior Quality Assurance About the Role We are seeking a highly skilled Automation QA Engineer with expertise in AI-driven testing to join our quality engineering team. The ideal candidate will have strong experience in building automated test frameworks, integrating AI/ML tools to optimize testing workflows, and ensuring the reliability, scalability, and performance of complex applications. Key Responsibilities Design, develop, and maintain robust test automation frameworks for web, mobile, API, and enterprise applications. Leverage AI/ML-powered tools (e.g., Testim, Mabl, Applitools, Functionize, or custom AI solutions) to enhance test automation, defect prediction, and intelligent test case generation. Implement self-healing test scripts to reduce test maintenance effort. Collaborate with development, DevOps, and product teams to ensure continuous testing in CI/CD pipelines. Analyze large test execution data sets to identify trends, flakiness, and performance bottlenecks. Integrate AI-based test data generation and predictive analytics to optimize coverage. Ensure high standards of quality for functional, regression, integration, and performance testing. Mentor junior QA engineers on test automation best practices and AI-driven testing methodologies. Required Skills & Qualifications Bachelors/Master\u2019s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or related field. 4\u20138 years of experience in Test Automation and Quality Assurance. Proficiency in automation tools/frameworks: Selenium, Cypress, Playwright, Appium, RestAssured, TestNG/JUnit . Strong programming skills in Python, Java, or JavaScript/TypeScript . Experience with CI/CD pipelines (Jenkins, GitHub Actions, GitLab CI, Azure DevOps). Hands-on experience with AI testing tools (Testim, Applitools, Mabl, etc.) Familiarity with LLMs (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini) for testing purposes Prompt engineering know-how Experience testing AI-powered features (chatbots, NLP, recommendations) Knowledge of Responsible AI principles and bias detection Exposure to AI observability/MLOps platforms Data quality testing for ML datasets Familiarity with AI coding assistants like GitHub Copilot Familiarity with cloud-based testing platforms (BrowserStack, Sauce Labs). Strong understanding of API testing (Postman, Karate, RestAssured) and performance testing (JMeter, k6, Locust). Knowledge of AI concepts such as NLP, anomaly detection, predictive analytics, and generative AI for QA is a plus. Preferred Skills Experience with self-healing test automation frameworks . Exposure to GenAI (LLMs) for test case generation and automation. Knowledge of microservices testing and containerized environments (Docker, Kubernetes). Experience in shift-left testing and TestOps practices. Soft Skills Strong problem-solving and analytical abilities. Excellent communication and collaboration skills. Ability to adapt to rapidly changing technologies and environments. What We Offer Opportunity to work with cutting-edge AI-driven QA technologies . Collaborative, innovative, and inclusive work culture. Competitive salary and benefits package. Career growth with exposure to AI and next-gen automation practices.\n\nKey Skills: Python,Artificial Intelligence,Playwright,Microsoft Azure,AWS,Microsoft,Quality assurance,Intelligence"},{"title":"Walk-in || Plc Automation Engineer","company":"Balamurugan","location":"Remote","date_posted":"2026-09-07","url":"https://www.naukri.com/job-listings-plc-automation-engineer-infotech-controls-chennai-0-to-3-years-070926030186","is_walkin":true,"walkin_date":"07 Sep - 30 Sep","walkin_time":"9.30 AM - 5.30 PM","contact_phone":"8870408690","description":"Time and Venue:\nInterview Date: 07 Sep - 30 Sep\nTiming: 9.30 A